  "description": "An African American man who was severely beaten by Los Angeles police officers on March 3, 1991. The incident was captured on video and sparked national outrage. The subsequent acquittal of the officers in April 1992 was a catalyst for the 1992 Los Angeles riots. His case became a symbol of systemic racism and police brutality in America.",
